<title>JAPAN: Chichibu Railway - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chichibu Railway - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.34		vs	    4.28</p>
<p> Operating   loss 277 million	 vs   loss 499 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 296 million	 vs   loss 521 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 178 million	 vs   loss 494 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 11.92 yen	  vs    loss 32.98 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Chichibu Railway Co Ltd is a regional electric railway operator.</p>
